## Removing the Header

The **Table Header** (the title and optional subtitle) is removed with the `~~GT.rm_header()` method. It takes no arguments and clears the entire header at once.

::: {#3e36c312 .cell execution_count=2}
``` {.python .cell-code}
gt_tbl.rm_header()
```

